     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>一、试场编排</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><U><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT color=#0000ff><A title=名校协作体学生准考证号 href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201902/2019022508020962.xls">名校协作体学生准考证号</A></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></U></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">除化学试场外，各班教室按照</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>35</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">位布置，化学试场和自修教室按照</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>37</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">位布置，其他要求同高二。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>二、监考安排</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">请各位老师<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">提前</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>20</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分钟</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">到图书馆考务组领劵贴条码，贴好后直入试场，提前</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分钟发卷。学生开考铃响后才能答题，结束铃响后立即停笔。<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">答题卡收齐后务必清点数量，全部回收（包括缺考学生）</B>，回收后交回考务组。</SPAN></FONT></P>
